# Control for W1 Covariates at W1, W2, W3

W1_E_Directive + W2_E_Directive + W3_E_Directive ~ c1*L_Age + c2*E_Age + c3*L_Sex + c4*E_Sex + c5*L_Educ.Low + c6*L_Educ.High + c7*Level.Low + c8*Level.High +
