Axel,
These are the steps that I would take in your position:
1. Request the matrix representation of the free parameters from each software package and compare them.
2. Use the Mplus estimates as start values in lavaan and see if it converges to the same solution.
3. Fit the model to data simulated from a fully specified version of the model, using both packages and compare the results.

