Dear All,

I have a correlation at level 1 (profile correlation between self- and informant-report). Can I move this correlation as a variable to level 2?

model <- '

    level: 1

        fw1 =~ y1 + y2 + y3 # self-rater

        fw2 =~ x4 + x5 + x6 # informant-rater

        cov := fw1 ~~ fw2 ## possible?

    level: 2

        cov ~ z1 + z2

'

Please let me know if you need any further information.

Many thanks in advance,

Karla

